  "releaseNotes": "17.6.2: Fixes Umbraco Deploy imports of evaluator configurations being silently rolled back: read-only database scopes now complete, so they no longer cancel the surrounding Deploy (or other) transaction. Requires the main package 17.6.2. 17.6.1: First release. Adds Umbraco Deploy support (Umbraco.AI.Deploy 17.3.1+) for evaluator configurations: they move between environments with their AI profile and context, adopt matching hand-made configurations on the first deploy, apply the source's active state, clear affected cached evaluations, and are removed by Deploy's schema clean-up when deleted at the source.",
